    },
    "Havus cuma nunjukin yang bisa dibersihin. Nggak ada yang dihapus tanpa persetujuan kamu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Havus only shows what can be cleaned up. Nothing is removed until you say so."
