          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mending dimatiin aja. Banyak aplikasi bikin lagi agent-nya kalau file-nya dihapus, sedangkan agent yang dimatiin biasanya tetap mati. Biar beres, hapus aplikasinya lewat **Hapus Aplikasi**." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turning an agent off usually works better. Many apps recreate their agent when its file is deleted, but one that's turned off usually stays off. To get rid of it for good, remove the app in **Uninstaller**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
