        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Havus can't read part of it, so the real size may be larger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sehari sekali, Havus bisa ngecek lewat internet apakah ada versi baru. Nggak ada data apa pun soal kamu atau Mac kamu yang dikirim. Bisa kamu ubah kapan aja di **Pengaturan → Umum**." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once a day, Havus can check online whether a new version is out. Nothing about you or your Mac is sent. You can change this anytime in **Settings → General**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sehari sekali, Havus nanya nomor versi terbaru ke GitHub. Nggak ada data apa pun soal kamu atau Mac kamu yang dikirim." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
