    "iOS Device Support" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS Device Support"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS nggak ngizinin Havus baca isi folder ini." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS doesn't let Havus read what's in this folder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS nggak ngizinin Havus baca isinya, jadi ukurannya belum ketahuan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS doesn't let Havus read what's inside, so its size is unknown."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS nggak ngizinin Havus mindahin file ini." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS didn't let Havus move this file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS ngunci beberapa lokasi, kayak Tong Sampah, lampiran Mail, dan data app lain. Dengan izin ini Havus bisa ngecek semuanya, dan tetap cuma ngehapus yang kamu pilih." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS locks some places, like the Trash, Mail attachments and other apps' data. With this permission Havus can check all of them, and still only removes what you pick."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS nolak mindahin %@. Coba nyalain Havus di **Privasi & Keamanan → Manajemen App**, atau hapus manual lewat Finder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS wouldn't move %@. Try turning on Havus in **Privacy & Security → App Management**, or remove it yourself in Finder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS nyimpen laporan crash-nya di Mac kamu. Isinya info teknis soal Havus dan macOS, bukan isi file kamu. Kalau kamu kirim, bug-nya bisa lebih cepat dibenerin. Havus nunjukin laporan itu dan catatan aktivitasnya di Finder, kamu tinggal lampirin." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS saved a crash report on your Mac. It has technical details about Havus and macOS, not what's in your files. Sending it helps get the bug fixed sooner. Havus shows it in Finder with its activity log, so you can attach them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
